# Resolute Reinforcements: flash (CR 702.8a) and "When this creature enters, create a 1/1 white Soldier creature token." Bot1 holds
# two Moxen untapped through its own turn 1 and casts it in Bot2's end step on turn 2. A Helpful Hunter in the same hand, which
# has no flash, is not castable then (a creature spell only at sorcery speed, CR 307.1, 601.3), the pair that shows the flash is
# what allows it. The Reinforcements, a 1/1 Human Soldier, and the Soldier token it makes (1/1, white, a token) both end up on
# Bot1's battlefield, and Bot2 gets nothing.

[Bot1 Deck]
Resolute Reinforcements
Helpful Hunter
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Plains x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

